# 5. Redistribution Requirements

If you redistribute the Software, whether in source or compiled form, you must comply with all requirements in this section.

## 5.1 Same License

The Software and any Modified Version must be distributed under this license.

You may not replace, remove, weaken, or override this license for the Software.

## 5.2 Copyright Notice

You must retain:

* the original copyright notice;
* attribution to yo-le-zz;
* this license;
* and any existing notices required by third-party licenses.

You may add additional copyright notices for your own modifications, but you may not remove or obscure the original copyright notice.

## 5.3 Modification Notice

If you redistribute a Modified Version, you must provide a Modification Notice.

The notice must be sufficiently clear that a reasonable recipient can distinguish the Modified Version from the Original Software.

For example:

> This version is a modified version of Cosmya by yo-le-zz.
> Modifications were made by Example Developer in August 2026.
> Changes include: redesigned audit engine, additional Rust analysis, and new reporting features.

## 5.4 No Misrepresentation

You may not represent a Modified Version as the Original Software.

You may not falsely claim that yo-le-zz created, approved, endorsed, maintains, or supports your Modified Version.

The name "Cosmya" may not be used in a manner that reasonably implies official endorsement by yo-le-zz unless explicit permission has been granted.

## 5.5 License Availability

A copy of this license must accompany every redistribution of the Software or Modified Version.

For online distributions, the license must be included in the repository, package, archive, or another location reasonably accessible to recipients.

